<title>FINLAND: K-SUOMEN MEDIA HAS 92 PCT OF S.SANOMAT.</title>
<headline>K-SUOMEN MEDIA HAS 92 PCT OF S.SANOMAT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish regional newspaper publishing group Keski-Suomen Media Oy said on Wednesday it had over 92 percent of the shares and votes in newspaper publisher Savon Sanomat Oy as the result of a redemption offer.</p>
<p>&quot;After the redemption offer, Keski Suomen Media Oy owns a total of 2,555,815 Savon Sanomat Oy shares, which is 92.21 percent of the company's share capital and votes,&quot; Keski-Suomen Media Oy said in a statement.</p>
</text>
